Exact accumulation for OpenCPMD. Default off (-D__EXACT_ACC).
Against 062582b7cfd832d36f88f504cd08e4ead42eb404.

Force components are exact sums of the same per-G or per-atom terms.
The nonlocal force, the local force, and the Ewald ion-ion force each
finish through the superaccumulator. The final fion reduction is one
exact merge when forces are requested.

